---
description: Require explicit target-account selection for AWS deployments
alwaysApply: true
---

# AWS Deployment Account

Before performing any AWS deployment or AWS resource mutation, ask the user
which AWS account ID to use.

- Do not infer the target account from the active AWS profile, Terraform state,
  existing infrastructure, or previous deployments.
- Confirm the selected account with `aws sts get-caller-identity` before making
  changes.
